  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.0.0 - First Stable Production Release\n\n✨ Features:\n• 10 comprehensive analyzer rules (AM001-AM030)\n• Intelligent code fixes for all diagnostics\n• Complete type safety, data integrity, and complex mapping analysis\n• 131 passing tests with zero build errors\n\n📦 Improvements:\n• Unified package structure (no separate CodeFixes package needed)\n• Professional samples with 122 warnings demonstrating all rules\n• Clean .editorconfig configuration for samples\n• Cross-platform support (.NET Framework 4.8+, .NET 6+, 8+, 9+)\n\n📚 Documentation:\n• Comprehensive README with real-world examples\n• 248-line samples guide with usage patterns\n• Full diagnostic rules reference\n\n🔗 Full Release Notes: https://github.com/georgepwall1991/automapper-analyser/releases/tag/v2.0.0",
